+Rows that describe WoW Forever were measured on the beta client. The released
+client installs into `_forever_`, and the launcher writes its own `portal`,
+`textLocale` and `audioLocale` when it installs the game. Every package this
+repository builds carries the macOS system root certificates the client needs to
+validate Battle.net's certificate; a build without them cannot log in
+(`BLZ51900003`), whatever the execution mode.
